Note on earlier versions
------------------------
Until 20 August 2026 some of these games displayed a Creative Commons notice
(CC BY-SA 4.0 or CC BY-NC-SA 4.0) in their credits screen. Those notices have
been withdrawn and no longer apply to this or any later version. Creative
Commons licences are irrevocable for copies already distributed, so anyone who
obtained one of those earlier versions keeps the rights that version granted,
for that version only.


